I walk to the apartment.
I have the bags of groceries in my hands.
These bags are very heavy.
I see Anitha near the stairs.
She sees me.
Anitha comes near the main door.
She holds the door open for me.
"Thank you, Anitha," I say.
"Are the bags very heavy?" she asks.
"Yes, they are very heavy," I reply.
I slowly walk inside.
Anitha sees the vegetables in my bags.
"Does Maya like cooking?" she asks.
"Yes, I like cooking," I say.
"What do you want for dinner today?" Anitha asks.
"I want a vegetable curry today," I say.
"I have fresh vegetables with me."
"That is very good," she says.
I look at her and smile.
I slowly go to my flat.
